## 0. WHAT THIS REDESIGN FIXES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

The current app has three problems this redesign solves:
1. Everything is cramped — not enough breathing room, text too close together,
   cards touching, tight padding. Fix: a generous spacing system (Section 3).
2. The bottom tab bar is crowded with too many tabs. Fix: remove the bottom tab
   bar entirely. Move navigation into a menu (Section 7).
3. The visual style looks generic. Fix: a premium wellness aesthetic with a
   warm orange-and-white palette, soft depth, and editorial typography.

Keep ALL existing functionality, screens, data flow, Supabase integration,
rules engine, consent logic, and safety gates. This is a visual + navigation
redesign only. Do not delete or rewrite business logic.

