## 6. CORE COMPONENTS (build in components/ui/ first)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Build these BEFORE any screen. Every screen is assembled from them.

**PrimaryButton**
- Height 60px (tall, easy, premium), full width minus screen padding
- Orange gradient fill (#E8650A → #FF8C42), left to right
- 18px radius, white text 17px semibold, Shadow.button
- Pressed: scale 0.97
- Haptics.impactAsync(Medium) on press
- Disabled: #F0E8E2 fill, #C4BBB4 text, no shadow

**SecondaryButton**
- Height 56px, white fill, 1.5px orange border, orange text 17px semibold, 18px radius

**Card**
- White fill, 24px radius, 24px padding, Shadow.soft
- This is the workhorse. Most content lives in these.

**ChoiceCard** (for all questionnaire options — NEVER radio dots)
- Full width, min height 60px, 20px padding, 20px radius
- Unselected: white, 1.5px #F0E8E2 border
- Selected: #FFF3EC fill, 2px #E8650A border, orange checkmark right
- 16px text, Haptics.impactAsync(Light) on tap

**Chip** — fully round, 13px padding H, 7px padding V, status colours from theme

**ListRow** — 18px vertical padding (roomy), label left, value/chevron right,
hairline divider below (except last row)

**SectionTitle** — Fraunces serif heading with 40px top margin, 20px bottom margin

**Hero** — top-of-screen section, warm gradient wash background (#FFF3EC → #FDFAF8),
32px bottom radius, generous 32px internal padding, serif title inside

