## 9. MOTION
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
- Screen transitions: slide, 300ms, ease-out
- Button press: scale 0.97
- Menu drawer: slide in from right, 280ms ease-out, with a dimmed backdrop
- Card tap: subtle scale 0.98
- Haptics on every primary interaction (expo-haptics)
- Respect useReducedMotion — cut animation if enabled
- No looping/idle animations

